.TH SDL_PIXELLAYOUT 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_PIXELLAYOUT \- A macro to retrieve the layout of an
.BR SDL_PixelFormat .

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_pixels.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_PIXELLAYOUT(format)  (((format) >> 16) & 0x0F)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is usually a value from the
.BR SDL_PackedLayout
enumeration, or zero if a layout doesn\(aqt make sense for the format type\[char46]

.SH MACRO PARAMETERS
.TP
.I format
an
.BR SDL_PixelFormat
to check\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the layout of
.BR format \[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this macro from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

